{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03139","headline":"别乡人南还 · 张九龄","name":"别乡人南还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"橘柚南中暖，桑榆北地阴。\n何言荣落异，因见别离心。\n吾亦江乡子，思归梦寐深。\n闻君去水宿，结思渺云林。\n牵缀从浮事，迟回谢所钦。\n东南行舫远，秋浦念猿吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}